      "created_at": "2024-05-20T14:31:12.350Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would like to know if there is any way to remove or hide the “status” and “id” filing from the view list.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/1/11861e8542156ebc3501f6aa9e2ba40f7af1e945.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/11861e8542156ebc3501f6aa9e2ba40f7af1e945\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/1/11861e8542156ebc3501f6aa9e2ba40f7af1e945_2_690x157.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"2v1sTHpKuuHQHfez2LaOOuo12ct\" width=\"690\" height=\"157\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/1/11861e8542156ebc3501f6aa9e2ba40f7af1e945_2_690x157.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/1/11861e8542156ebc3501f6aa9e2ba40f7af1e945_2_1035x235.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/1/11861e8542156ebc3501f6aa9e2ba40f7af1e945_2_1380x314.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1440×329 36.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
