    {
      "id": 410206,
      "username": "Manav_Mandli",
      "name": "Manav Mandli",
      "created_at": "2024-05-20T19:34:10.727Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hii <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/talita.mangolin\">@Talita.Mangolin</a></p>\n<p>To display your required fields in a list view, you can set the fields you want:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/1/714cf21c376312f951675439ef5e27ea7ee9a10d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/714cf21c376312f951675439ef5e27ea7ee9a10d\" title=\"Screenshot 2024-05-21 010058\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/714cf21c376312f951675439ef5e27ea7ee9a10d_2_690x336.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-05-21 010058\" data-base62-sha1=\"gaiOcjr5LnGMGaIssWEQ30EWQIB\" width=\"690\" height=\"336\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/714cf21c376312f951675439ef5e27ea7ee9a10d_2_690x336.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/714cf21c376312f951675439ef5e27ea7ee9a10d_2_1035x504.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/714cf21c376312f951675439ef5e27ea7ee9a10d_2_1380x672.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2024-05-21 010058</span><span class=\"informations\">1477×721 46.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I hope it works for you,<br>\nthank you</p>",
