    {
      "id": 410223,
      "username": "NCP",
      "name": "Nihantra Patel",
      "created_at": "2024-05-21T04:17:53.890Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can’t remove the ID from the Listview Settings,</p>\n<p>If you want to remove the ID then you have to apply the Listview client script.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">frappe.listview_settings[\"DocType\"] = {\n\thide_name_column: true\n};\n</code></pre>\n<aside class=\"quote\" data-post=\"5\" data-topic=\"89658\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ncp/48/66573_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/hide-name-filter/89658/5\">Hide Name Filter</a> \n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ca_b.c_chechani\">@CA_B.C_Chechani</a>, \nPlease apply it. \nfrappe.listview_settings['Your_DocType'] = {\n    refresh: function(listview) {\n       // Hide name filter from Listview\n        $(\"div[data-fieldname = name]\").hide();\n    },\n    // Hide name from Listview\n\t hide_name_column: true\n};\n\nReload and check it, please. \nThank You!\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ncp/{size}/66573_2.png",
