    {
      "id": 410365,
      "username": "Talita.Mangolin",
      "name": "Talita",
      "created_at": "2024-05-21T14:07:20.643Z",
      "cooked": "<p>One more question, to hide the listview comment icon, I’m using the following code:</p>\n<p>$(“.comment-count”).hide();</p>\n<p>But it didn’t work in v14.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/f/df73aaa575b5f40963b9680c0a3220f0996a215b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/df73aaa575b5f40963b9680c0a3220f0996a215b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/f/df73aaa575b5f40963b9680c0a3220f0996a215b_2_690x110.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"vSKi0pGjb8dNtVhaaLvhV32QPYD\" width=\"690\" height=\"110\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/f/df73aaa575b5f40963b9680c0a3220f0996a215b_2_690x110.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/f/df73aaa575b5f40963b9680c0a3220f0996a215b_2_1035x165.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/f/df73aaa575b5f40963b9680c0a3220f0996a215b.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F6F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1317×210 21.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>complete code:</p>\n<p>frappe.listview_settings[‘Opportunity’] = {<br>\nrefresh: function(listview) {<br>\n$(“div[data-fieldname = name]”).hide();<br>\n$(“.comment-count”).hide();<br>\n$(“use.like-icon”).hide();<br>\n},<br>\nhide_name_column: true<br>\n};</p>",
